{"title":"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered pairs of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/43932ab5c4a67d420e445a6028df63fb4aca0f6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} \\leq y \\leq x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea7d20312d2e15f39a6659127591049dfad8b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} &gt; x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/0/40021522907621bc0f912e4deafdda58a6d30922.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> and that those two are equal if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> also must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b31b51deaa1a9e903d120a02141556c3e70e348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> because otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/a/26a2153d0dd0f8c7016f8a7d470461751b1a478b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or less and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e87b69178d197c13b13d595e7e6817cf20df95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> would be more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means that we can try out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>A table can also be used to keep track of this.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f0d163cd84fe729be8aea1b570bd411e000583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\leq y \\leq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The only way for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> while being less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/a/61a79da7e7844d252be666cb25e2ed8a2c9a96e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, so there's only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibility here.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/1/c517be937383b9163e1af81f0fe375e42a067f0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq y \\leq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can be any integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (inclusive), giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/2/12297f9b0add40f601ab4ef6049206386ac06978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 1 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/3/703e2517e79cfd93c94009d1470dfddf94b27e53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq y \\leq 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can be any integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (inclusive), giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c7f5f3e1995c067bb9b6cd12a5f99390cd612a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 - 0 + 1 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5879f32a58f7b38914733093ff8f2c9e0b34c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 7 = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7bf61baad4a4e5fbd2d9415215fea70e4d4d05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq y \\leq 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can be any integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (inclusive), giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b2cb3260d9e890a840f764cd80058d55b43eb3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 + 7 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba0f658d06ef988d6e69f6fb45e4af0f80f96d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\leq y \\leq 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can be any integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (inclusive), giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b44780f26d21c72017da214ccbe1376f15a518.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 - 4 + 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a726eb9ec4aac93443a676dc359abb63d2d5a39f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 + 5 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/295548330fbf805d2ab8477403a109b862ea01cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\leq y \\leq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The only way for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> while being less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/972a1b28ebab46d3b5cee3b8f37eb94361b9da88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, so there's only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibility here. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89c1770e4582b2a114edec4b234880197c8d8c25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 + 1 = \\boxed{26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC\" title=\"2019 CSMC\">2019 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062516\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 241/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10285/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.407      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.407      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37329:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018062516 and revision id 288248. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}